Four proved helpers inserted after `pow_val_bijective`, with their `## Main results` bullets:
`BilinearGroup.pow_val_add`, `pow_val_neg`, `pow_val_bijective_of_ne_one` and `natCast_inj_of_lt`.
Pure insertions; no new import. Mathlib states none of them in a directly usable form.

